WEBVTT

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.980
I won't forgive you!

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:13.520
You loathsome humans!

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:19.510
This squid will invade your
rotten surface world!

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:56.880
<b>Who's up for a squid-vasion?</b>

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:07.520
Lemon House at the Sea

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:15.430
Sis, are the fried noodles done?

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:18.240
They're done, Eiko.

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:19.990
Here are your beers.

00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:21.510
Another beer here.

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:22.370
Coming right up.

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:36.210
Humans, listen up.

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:41.600
I am going to use this house as a base
to squidly subdue humanity!

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:51.090
I guess you're too
scared to say anything.

00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:54.750
Don't worry, I won't kill you.

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:57.890
I have enough petty jobs to
keep you all busy!

00:02:57.890 --> 00:03:00.060
All right, that's enough.

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:03.450
What the squid are you doing?

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:05.990
Where the squid are
you taking me?

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:09.730
Just one question:
What are you cosplaying as?

00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:12.960
Oh, that's right, I haven't
introduced myself yet.

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:15.400
I am a messenger from the sea,

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:18.510
Squid Girl!

00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:25.260
Hmm, her reaction isn't what I expected.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:27.470
Why our store?

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.130
It's the closest to the squidly sea!

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:32.940
I am going to use it as a base for
squidly subduing humanity!

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.900
Why subdue humanity?

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:37.190
Isn't it squidding obvious?!

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:41.290
Humans have forgotten
what they owe the sea

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:44.190
and have polluted it for their own ends
without a second thought!

00:03:44.630 --> 00:03:46.790
For us creatures of the sea,

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:49.160
humans are nothing but a parasite!

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:51.960
That's why I will subdue
the human race!

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:54.330
In order to protect the sea!

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:57.000
Huh?

00:03:57.340 --> 00:04:01.960
I understand, but we're
busy with work today,

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:03.300
so come again some other time.

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:05.640
Be careful on your way home.

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:08.760
Oh, thanks.

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:16.220
Wait! Don't think for one squidding
minute that I'm just bluffing!

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:17.850
Listen to me!

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:21.530
Here are the fried noodles
for table 3.

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:23.070
The soy-flavor ramen is for table 5.

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:29.750
Fr-Fried noodles table 3, ramen table 5...

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:31.400
I need chopsticks.

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:32.620
Can I get some water?

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:33.740
Another one of these please.

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:35.190
A bowl of dry noodles and
dumplings please.

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:36.680
Just one squidding moment, please!

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:38.960
Two snowcones: one strawberry
and one sweet milk.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:39.560
One highball.

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:40.330
One spaghetti aglio, olio e peperoncino.

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:41.630
Fried chicken and steamed
dumplings.

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:42.060
A bowl with young sardines.

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:43.040
I understand.

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:44.280
Can you bus these?

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:45.510
Right a-squidly-way.

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:46.910
Two fried noodles to go.

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:46.910
I'm returning a swim ring.

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:47.790
Ice cream!

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:49.470
Three pot stickers please.

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:49.470
Can I get my bags?

00:04:48.460 --> 00:04:50.280
I'd like to use the shower.

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:56.920
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
I'm squidly sorry!

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:57.900
Don't touch that!

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:01.870
You could hurt yourself.
Sheesh, be careful.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.360
She didn't scold me even though
I made a mistake.

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:07.820
Instead she worried about me...

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:11.380
Her face is scary,
but she's actually nice.

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:13.700
Don't worry about these,
bring these out instead.

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:14.910
Got it!

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:19.950
Wait, what am I doing?

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:22.600
This squid came here to
subdue the human race!

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:24.590
I didn't come here to
get a squidding job!

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.990
Yeah, yeah, we get it.

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:29.070
If you don't feel like working,

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:30.640
go home instead of
getting in the way.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:33.420
This isn't a squidding game!
I really am going to invade-

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:36.210
You keep talking about invading.

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:38.650
How many customers do
you think we have today?

00:05:40.450 --> 00:05:44.230
Huh? Many? Lots?
Tentacles of thousands?

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:46.630
30, 30 people.

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:48.810
Do you really think you can
subdue the human race,

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:51.660
if you can't even handle
that many people?

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:54.070
Subduing the human race means

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:58.120
that you have to control
6.4 billion people by yourself.

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:00.830
Billion?

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:02.840
How many did you
think there were?

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:06.110
I thought it was about
a thousand...

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:08.840
So you thought you could handle
about a thousand, huh?

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:12.330
By the way, if you make the entire
human race your enemy,

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:15.250
all the armies of the entire
world will be your enemy.

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:16.890
Are you ready for that?

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:18.790
What the squid is an army?

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:19.850
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:21.510
Then what about guns(juu)?

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:22.790
Ten(juu)?

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:23.850
Missiles?

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:25.090
Miso soup?

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:29.250
I came to the surface world
for the first time today.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:31.920
How am I supposed
to know all that?!

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:54.940
Someone who can't even
handle a single mosquito

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:56.480
wants to subdue humanity...

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:02.950
I'll show you my full squid
tentacle powers then!

00:07:14.710 --> 00:07:15.960
Squid wins!

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:22.340
Did you see that?

00:07:22.340 --> 00:07:24.720
There's nothing I can't do.

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:29.530
Looks like you're too scared
and awed to speak.

00:07:29.870 --> 00:07:36.230
How dare you destroy the
wall of our store!

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:39.490
Who cares, it's going
to be mine anyway.

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:40.560
No, it won't.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:45.640
Are you actually controlling these?

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:46.900
Yes.

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:48.560
Speed!

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:50.320
Power!

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:51.780
Reach!

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:53.240
Delicacy!

00:07:54.120 --> 00:08:00.200
These ten tentacles always catch their
prey and never let it escape.

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:03.470
That's squid 101 for ya.

00:08:03.470 --> 00:08:05.460
That's far beyond what a
normal squid can do...

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:09.660
Hey, you said you wanted to make
this house your base, right?

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:10.690
Damn squiddy!

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:11.470
You can.

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:14.210
R-Really?

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:14.960
Yup.

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:21.460
Why do I have to squidding work?

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:24.650
You have to pay for the damage
with your tentacles.

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:27.480
Oh my, we have a new worker.

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:30.660
This is squid abuse!

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:35.960
Squid Girl, this is for table 4.

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:36.910
Got it.

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:38.650
Restock the cokes in the fridge.

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:39.990
I'm on it already!

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:45.000
<b>Hold on a squid, aren't you a compatriot?</b>

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:52.770
I came to conquer them,
not to squidding do this.

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:07.360
I must be imagining things.

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:22.090
I feel like I'm being watched...

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:42.720
These wavy things are fun.

00:09:43.090 --> 00:09:45.070
Wavy things?

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:47.690
How dare he! These are my tentacles!

00:09:48.030 --> 00:09:51.150
Wow, they move. Weird!

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:54.160
This is no good.
He doesn't get it.

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:58.610
I have to teach him how
scary this squid is.

00:10:06.150 --> 00:10:07.150
That was fun!

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:08.100
That's the opposite
of what I wanted.

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:10.140
Again! Again!

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:11.420
Again! Again!

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:16.590
I know! I'll play with you if you
become my squid-underling!

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:18.430
Underling?

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:21.490
I am Squid Girl, a messenger
from the sea!

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:23.770
You have to call me "Captain".

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:26.220
Oh, and address your
superior squid correctly!

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:28.850
Roger, Captain!

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:31.480
Oh, I can get used to this!

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:37.170
Let's immediately get started on our
squid-vasion plan to conquer the surface world!

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:38.530
Roger, Captain!

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:41.770
First, let's occupy this place!

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:42.490
Yeah!

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:43.950
Squid attack!

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:44.790
Aye!

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:49.160
What are you doing, Squid Girl?

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:52.800
This place is now under
my squidly control!

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:53.850
Oh, Takeru, you came?

00:10:53.850 --> 00:10:54.700
Yup, Sis.

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:55.340
Huh?!

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:58.560
Sis? That means he's her brother?

00:10:58.560 --> 00:11:01.550
I became the captain's underling

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:03.610
and we're going to conquer
the surface world!

00:11:03.610 --> 00:11:05.600
I see, using my brother, huh?

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:06.810
We're just playing around.

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:08.770
It was just an invasion game.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:11.100
What? You said you'd make
me your underling!

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:14.270
I don't have time to
deal with human children!

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:16.150
I'm squidly busy!

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:17.780
Wait, Squid Girlie...

00:11:20.230 --> 00:11:22.200
"Human children"?

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:24.660
I know!

00:11:24.940 --> 00:11:26.490
Takeru, what are you doing?

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:28.610
Do you think I'll look like
a squid boy with this?

00:11:28.610 --> 00:11:30.470
Boy? Ohh.

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:32.500
It's that thing Squid Girl has.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.090
It's so good that I can't
see a difference.

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:37.520
Doesn't that mean it's so simple

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:39.840
that even a grade schooler
can make it?

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:47.170
I bet she'll yell something
like, "Don't squidly copy me!"

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:49.220
See? She's mad.

00:11:50.010 --> 00:11:52.730
I can't believe I met
a compatriot here!

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:53.600
What?

00:11:54.220 --> 00:11:57.210
You must have come to squid-vade
the surface world, too!

00:11:57.210 --> 00:11:59.190
Th-That's squidly right.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:02.190
Has she not realized
that it's Takeru?

00:12:02.190 --> 00:12:04.720
I guess that thing is enough

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:07.580
to be recognized as one of them.

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:11.350
Let's jump right to it and discuss
our squid invasion strategy.

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:12.460
Yes we squid!

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:16.950
I have been tasked with cleaning
the floor of that house.

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:19.940
Which means that I've essentially
conquered the ground.

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:23.300
The next targets are the
chairs and the tables.

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:26.570
I guess she must be really happy
to have met a compatriot,

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:29.060
but I'm actually just-

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:32.390
Which means that you should squidly
take care of the counter region.

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:35.640
Uh, sure, why the tentacle not?

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:38.900
By the way, where are
your tentacles?

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:41.360
C-Can you hold on a squid?

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:43.330
What's wrong?

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:45.320
Sis, actually...

00:12:49.570 --> 00:12:52.040
I'm back.

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:55.250
Oh, good for you,
your tentacles grew back.

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:57.400
Yay, we managed to fool her.

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:58.710
That warrants a "yay"?

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:03.650
However, aren't your tentacles
a bit thin and lifeless?

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:05.750
No, I don't think so.

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:08.070
They seem like they're
just hanging down.

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:10.050
Sure they're okay?

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:12.020
Just wait a squid!

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:24.840
Oh, look how energetic they are.
You should be squidly fine!

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:28.010
All right, let's commence
our squid attack!

00:13:28.010 --> 00:13:29.490
What? Now?

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:33.520
Taking that house will be no
problem with two squids!

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:36.460
I don't know about this
oversimplified plan...

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:42.630
Where are you going?

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:54.890
And I thought...

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:56.350
She found out!

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:58.920
...that I had finally
met a compatriot.

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:01.560
Why did you have to rush
to Davy Jones' Locker?!

00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:06.330
Squid Girlie...

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:09.950
You're no longer my underling
and I'm not your captain either!

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:11.530
She went back to treating
me as a human.

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:15.270
Poor compatriot,

00:14:18.360 --> 00:14:23.460
at least rest peacefully
in our homeland.

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:44.210
Well, sorry, I guess.

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:52.380
Farewell, my squid-in-arms!

00:14:59.770 --> 00:15:02.830
<b>Aren't I just the squiddiest?</b>

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:17.470
The store is so quiet when it rains.

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:20.980
What is it?

00:15:21.450 --> 00:15:24.860
Who's the woman with
the squidly long hair?

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:27.230
Huh? She's been here
the whole time!

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:29.090
I know that!

00:15:29.090 --> 00:15:33.060
Does she have anything to do
with you or your brother?

00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:37.670
You didn't realize?
She's my older sister.

00:15:37.670 --> 00:15:39.160
Her name's Chizuru.

00:15:39.430 --> 00:15:40.810
Sister?

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.440
No squidding way!

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:49.130
You're violent, and your brother is
loud and follows people around,

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:53.750
but that one's not violent at all and looks
to be totally on the squid-and-narrow!

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:56.760
Sorry for being so violent!

00:15:56.760 --> 00:16:00.430
Eiko, you shouldn't
pick on Squid Girl.

00:16:01.510 --> 00:16:02.850
She's nice!

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:06.430
Squid Girl, could you carry this?

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:08.190
Roger!

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:19.360
It's kind of cold today.

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:21.670
What are you sneezing out?!

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:23.810
What the squid are you
freaking out about?

00:16:24.260 --> 00:16:26.540
It's just squid ink.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:30.110
I thought you coughed up blood!
Wipe it off already!

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:32.090
Oh yeah, it's squid ink.

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:35.100
You're so calm!
And she licked it!

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:38.040
Squid Girl, you're really
quite squiddy huh?

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:39.710
What's "squiddy"?

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:42.750
Why don't you go take a shower,
you smell like squid ink.

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:46.060
I'll do that.
Watch the store, okay?

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:50.000
I bet you wouldn't
have forgiven me.

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:51.380
Of course not!

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:54.340
Thanks to you

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:57.240
I won't be able to eat spaghetti
with squid ink for a while.

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:59.870
Spaghetti... with squid ink?

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:04.080
Humans eat this?

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:06.630
Hey, don't spit that
out in front of me!

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:07.850
Yeah, we do.

00:17:07.850 --> 00:17:10.550
We mix it with spaghetti
and squid meat.

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:11.530
Meat?

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:12.840
Wait, are you planning to...

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:13.990
Like I'd eat you!

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:16.260
Maybe not you, but other guests...

00:17:25.030 --> 00:17:27.360
There are no humans here.

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:29.140
Well, it's raining.

00:17:29.140 --> 00:17:32.510
Do humans disappear
when it rains?

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:35.720
I doubt there are people who want
to play around on a day like this.

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:39.700
Right now, the only people here

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:42.820
are that quiet, black-haired Chizuru,

00:17:42.820 --> 00:17:44.860
that obnoxious kid Takeru,

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:48.330
and this one, who's kind of strong.

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:52.050
Which means...

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:57.510
Eat before you're eaten!

00:17:57.940 --> 00:18:00.410
This is my chance to squidly
take over this house!

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:04.110
Today, today's my day to
make you squidly pay!

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:09.940
All right, I guess I'll
do some cleaning.

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:12.370
Squid Girl, help me.

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:13.760
Abso-squidly not.

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:17.500
Do you know what
position you're in?

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:19.610
Maybe you should
ask yourself that.

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:23.200
Human, you're so cocky.

00:18:23.630 --> 00:18:28.920
Why do you think I came
to the surface world?

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.100
Wasn't it to get a job?

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:31.710
No, to subdue the human race!

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:35.850
And to do that,
I need this house as a base.

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:40.050
And you happen to be in my way!

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:42.090
What are you doing?
Let go of me!

00:18:42.090 --> 00:18:45.940
Perhaps you should
watch your tone.

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:47.900
I could tear you apart
with one move.

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:50.120
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:51.060
Takeru, watch out!

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:53.710
Sis, that's not fair!
You're having fun all by yourself!

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:55.470
I want to play with Squid Girlie too!

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:58.150
Is that how you interpret
scary movies, too?

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:01.020
No need to ask, you'll
meet the same fate!

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:01.860
Yay!

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:04.330
Only one more.

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:05.920
Are you planning to lay
a hand on our sister?

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:09.630
You can't stop me.
I'm squiding serious today.

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:13.750
I think it'll be better for
you if you release us.

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:17.200
I'm surprised you're still
saying stuff like that.

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:20.290
No, I'm saying it for your sake.

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:22.180
Oh, what's going on?

00:19:22.580 --> 00:19:24.360
There you are.

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:26.140
Don't resist and be caught!

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:28.850
I'll give all three of you
one-way-tickets to hell!

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:55.210
Don't fool around in the store.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:19:59.680
O-Okay...

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:02.330
As long as you understand.

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:07.560
Now apologize to them.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.610
I'm squidly sorry.

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:14.600
It's fine.

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:15.530
I had fun!

00:20:15.530 --> 00:20:17.610
See, I told you it was
for your sake.

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:20.070
By the way, Squid Girl.

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:20.070
Yes?!

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:24.040
She's prepared something.

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:25.430
Can I have some squid ink?

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:27.340
Squid ink? You mean hers?

00:20:27.340 --> 00:20:27.910
Yes.

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:28.620
You're kidding, right?

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:31.580
Why? I mean, it's squid ink.

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:34.460
Before, when I was covered in it...

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:37.800
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
I'm squidly sorry!

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:42.420
No, it's fine.
I tasted it and the flavor was perfect.

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:45.380
Can I ask you to cover these?

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:50.170
You can have as much
squid ink as you like.

00:20:56.410 --> 00:20:58.020
And... done!

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:00.710
I want some, too!

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:04.110
Eiko, have some too.

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:06.700
I can't eat this after seeing
her vomit on it!

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:08.890
Just try it.

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:14.370
It's so good...

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:18.290
Squid Ink Spaghetti

00:21:18.430 --> 00:21:19.330
Damn, that's good!

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:22.300
This salty squid ink is amazing
after swimming.

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:23.720
Squid ink spaghetti.

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:24.780
Squid ink spaghetti, please.

00:21:24.780 --> 00:21:25.570
Another squid ink spaghetti.

00:21:25.570 --> 00:21:27.180
Squid ink spaghetti!

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:28.600
Two squid ink spaghettis.

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:29.470
Squid ink spaghetti.

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:30.040
Squid ink!

00:21:30.040 --> 00:21:30.930
Squid ink to go.

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:31.840
Squi-spa!

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:33.200
It's a hit.

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:34.000
Yeah!

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:36.020
They have no idea, either.

00:21:37.430 --> 00:21:39.860
Hey, four more portions.

00:21:42.930 --> 00:21:44.570
I'm all out.

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:48.530
I can't stay here.
All they do is squidly exploit me!

00:21:49.270 --> 00:21:51.330
Squid Girl, please,

00:21:52.320 --> 00:21:54.120
the customers are waiting.

00:21:56.910 --> 00:21:58.760
Okay! Right on it!

00:22:04.900 --> 00:22:09.340
Looks like she's finally realized
who's the scariest around here.

00:23:41.870 --> 00:23:44.600
I'm Squid Girl, Messenger from the Sea!

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:47.300
Next time: Wait a squid,
aren't you on my side?

00:23:47.300 --> 00:23:50.400
Up for a squid-celebration?
Wanna play with this squid?

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:54.480
Say no and I'll squid-vade you!
